It bundles or depends on third-party work that keeps its own licenses,
including but not limited to:

- celld (Deno / Cloudflare-compatible runtime)
- @tanstack/ai, @tanstack/ai-code-mode, @tanstack/ai-isolate-quickjs
- quickjs-emscripten / @jitl/quickjs-wasmfile-release-sync
- Effect (effect@4.0.0-rc.115)
- React, Vite, Zod

`worker/isolate.ts` adapts @tanstack/ai-isolate-quickjs for celld by using
a fuel-tick interrupt instead of Date.now(). That change is application
source in this repository, not an upstream patch file.

`worker/vendor/quickjs-loader.mjs` is the browser Emscripten loader required
because the default Node loader hangs on celld.
